WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.700
Oh, hello! Who are you?

2
00:00:10.701 --> 00:00:15.247
I'm a giant panda.

3
00:00:15.248 --> 00:00:19.974
Giant pandas are a type of bear.

4
00:00:19.975 --> 00:00:25.469
We're one of the rarest mammals on earth.

5
00:00:25.470 --> 00:00:28.685
Where do you live?

6
00:00:28.686 --> 00:00:33.303
Giant pandas live in China.

7
00:00:33.304 --> 00:00:38.862
We like misty mountain forests.

8
00:00:38.863 --> 00:00:42.817
What do you eat?

9
00:00:42.818 --> 00:00:49.213
Giant pandas mostly eat bamboo shoots and leaves.

10
00:00:49.214 --> 00:00:54.490
We eat a lot and we eat fast.

11
00:00:54.491 --> 00:01:00.073
We eat for 12 hours a day!

12
00:01:00.074 --> 00:01:04.233
Can giant pandas climb?

13
00:01:04.234 --> 00:01:09.870
Yes, giant pandas are great climbers.

14
00:01:09.871 --> 00:01:15.670
We can also swim very well.

15
00:01:15.671 --> 00:01:18.549
Do you live alone?

16
00:01:18.550 --> 00:01:23.546
Giant pandas usually live alone.

17
00:01:23.547 --> 00:01:28.356
But sometimes we eat together.

18
00:01:28.357 --> 00:01:32.849
Do giant pandas hibernate in winter?

19
00:01:32.850 --> 00:01:37.659
Most bears hibernate in winter.

20
00:01:37.660 --> 00:01:42.886
But giant pandas don't.

21
00:01:42.887 --> 00:01:49.272
We just find a warmer place for winter.

22
00:01:49.273 --> 00:01:52.178
Where do you sleep?

23
00:01:52.179 --> 00:01:57.815
Giant pandas sleep in many different places.

24
00:01:57.816 --> 00:02:07.808
Sometimes we nap in hollow logs.

25
00:02:07.809 --> 00:02:10.151
I'm hungry.

26
00:02:10.152 --> 00:02:15.861
I'm going to eat more bamboo.

27
00:02:15.862 --> 00:02:23.270
Good-bye, Giant Panda!

